cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "Resting-State EEG Processing Pipeline (NeuroGuide to Features)"
abstract: >-
  De-identified and generalized research code for reproducing the EEG
  conversion, preprocessing, PSD extraction, and periodic/aperiodic (FOOOF)
  feature-generation workflow. No participant data are included.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sleep and Affective Science Lab, Division of Clinical Psychology, Department of Psychology, Asia University"
    website: "https://chang-lab-psychology-website-one.vercel.app/"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/asiapsych/sleep-eeg-pipeline"
url: "https://chang-lab-psychology-website-one.vercel.app/"
keywords:
  - EEG
  - EEGLAB
  - FOOOF
  - spectral parameterization
  - aperiodic
  - preprocessing
  - NeuroGuide
date-released: "2026-06-10"
